### Index - listar produtos
GET {{baseUri}}/products HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Store - criar produto
POST {{baseUri}}/products HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "name": "mochila",
    "description": "preta"
}

### Show - buscar produto
GET {{baseUri}}/products/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update - atualizar produto
PUT {{baseUri}}/products/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "name": "caderno",
    "description": "Produto ATUALIZADO via API/REST"
}

### Destroy - excluir produto
DELETE {{baseUri}}/products/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}